<title>FRANCE: BHV H1 operating loss narrows.</title>
<headline>BHV H1 operating loss narrows.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating			   loss	13.0 vs  loss   25.6</p>
<p>    Pre-tax, pre-exceptional	profit    11.4 vs  profit 10.8</p>
<p>    Exceptional gains				0.5 vs	    7.7</p>
<p>    Financial			   gain	24.4 vs  gain   36.4</p>
<p>    Turnover				     1,671.2 vs	1,692.5</p>
<p>NOTE - Retailer Bazar de l'Hotel de Ville published its first half results in a newspaper advertisement.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
